WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.702
-Andy, nobody knows
the "Real Housewives" franchise

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:03.569
like you.

00:00:03.569 --> 00:00:04.603
The name of the book is

00:00:04.603 --> 00:00:05.839
"It's Not All
Diamonds and Rosé"?

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:06.839
-Correct.
-There you go.

00:00:06.839 --> 00:00:07.907
Preorder right now.

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:09.275
But look, there's a very --

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:11.277
There's a lot of iconic lines
out there on these shows,

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:12.879
and we want to put you
to the test.

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:14.581
This is a game called
"Who Said It?"

00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:16.349
Here we go.

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:18.351
-♪ Tell 'em who said it ♪

00:00:18.351 --> 00:00:20.086
♪ Tell 'em who said it, yeah ♪

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:21.721
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:22.855
-Now, here's how it works.

00:00:22.855 --> 00:00:24.356
I'm going to read you
real quotes

00:00:24.356 --> 00:00:26.159
from any "Real Housewives"
show, any one.

00:00:26.159 --> 00:00:27.160
-Okay.

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:28.027
-And you have to tell me
who said it.

00:00:28.027 --> 00:00:30.029
-Okay.
Is there a prize?

00:00:30.029 --> 00:00:31.064
-Uh...

00:00:31.064 --> 00:00:33.032
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.032 --> 00:00:34.300
Pride.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:35.468
-Pride.
-Pride, yeah.

00:00:35.468 --> 00:00:38.237
-Yeah, I will say,
if I mess this game up,

00:00:38.237 --> 00:00:41.374
I will do a major walk of shame
home to my place.

00:00:41.374 --> 00:00:42.909
-Yeah.
-Yeah. It'd be terrible.

00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:44.243
-Almost like me
when I went on your show

00:00:44.243 --> 00:00:45.611
and you did this
with Grateful Dead songs.

00:00:45.611 --> 00:00:47.479
-And you aced it.

00:00:47.479 --> 00:00:48.914
-I was pressured.
-Yes, yes.

00:00:48.914 --> 00:00:50.549
-Thank you. I appreciate it.
-Okay.

00:00:50.549 --> 00:00:52.886
-All right, ready?
The first quote is...

00:00:54.988 --> 00:00:55.955
-Yes.

00:00:55.955 --> 00:00:58.057
That was said by
Mary M. Cosby

00:00:58.057 --> 00:01:00.927
from "The Real Housewives
of Salt Lake City."

00:01:00.927 --> 00:01:02.428
Sunday nights on Bravo.
-Let's see who said it.

00:01:02.428 --> 00:01:04.130
Let's see who said it.

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:06.432
-And I said, "You smell
like hospital."

00:01:06.432 --> 00:01:08.301
[ Ding ]
-[ Laughs ] That is correct.

00:01:08.301 --> 00:01:09.669
That is correct!

00:01:09.669 --> 00:01:11.838
[ Applause ]

00:01:11.838 --> 00:01:12.838
All right, one for one.

00:01:12.838 --> 00:01:15.008
All right, quote...

00:01:17.142 --> 00:01:19.612
-"Who is Hunky Dory?"

00:01:19.612 --> 00:01:22.615
Said Kathy Hilton on "The Real
Housewives of Beverly Hills."

00:01:22.615 --> 00:01:23.817
-Let's show it.

00:01:23.817 --> 00:01:25.117
-Just sit there and pretend like

00:01:25.117 --> 00:01:28.421
everything is great
and hunky dory when it's not.

00:01:28.421 --> 00:01:30.222
-Who is Hunky Dory?

00:01:30.222 --> 00:01:31.357
[ Ding ]

00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:34.861
♪♪

00:01:34.861 --> 00:01:36.362
-It's so good.
-"Who is Hunky Dory?"

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:37.930
Kathy Hilton.
-It's so good.

00:01:37.930 --> 00:01:40.366
How dare anyone think
this show is scripted?

00:01:40.366 --> 00:01:41.700
-No, exactly.

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:44.103
-What writer's room could
come up with this brilliance?

00:01:44.103 --> 00:01:45.404
-That's correct.

00:01:45.404 --> 00:01:46.906
This one, I think
you're gonna get,

00:01:46.906 --> 00:01:48.174
but I love her and I love this.

00:01:48.174 --> 00:01:49.375
Here's the quote.

00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:55.848
-Yes. Well, I do know that
that is Ramona Singer.

00:01:55.848 --> 00:01:56.982
-Yeah. There we go.

00:01:56.982 --> 00:01:58.784
-I'm thinking you're making
a bigger mole --

00:01:58.784 --> 00:02:00.786
No, not a bigger mole.
-Mountain out of a mole hill?

00:02:00.786 --> 00:02:02.388
-Yeah, you're making a mountain
out of a hole mill.

00:02:02.388 --> 00:02:03.623
[ Ding ]

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:05.257
-Hole mill.
-Mountain out of a hole mill.

00:02:05.257 --> 00:02:07.192
-Yes.
-Yes.

00:02:07.192 --> 00:02:08.427
-All right, ready?
-Yeah.

00:02:08.427 --> 00:02:09.829
-The last quote is...

00:02:16.903 --> 00:02:18.538
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.538 --> 00:02:22.274
-One of the all-time greats

00:02:22.274 --> 00:02:24.276
from "The Real Housewives
of Atlanta,"

00:02:24.276 --> 00:02:26.045
Shereé Whitfield.

00:02:26.045 --> 00:02:27.547
-That is correct!
Let's take a look.

00:02:27.547 --> 00:02:28.615
You did it!

00:02:28.615 --> 00:02:29.982
-I felt the need to
tug on her wig.

00:02:29.982 --> 00:02:31.417
I did not try to pull it off.

00:02:31.417 --> 00:02:33.386
I did not want to pull it off.

00:02:33.386 --> 00:02:35.121
I just wanted to shift it
a little bit.

00:02:35.121 --> 00:02:37.957
[ Ding, ding, ding ]

00:02:37.957 --> 00:02:39.759
-And shift it she did.
-The champ!

00:02:39.759 --> 00:02:43.162
-Undisputed champion,
Andy Cohen, everybody!

00:02:43.162 --> 00:02:45.765
His show, "Watch What
Happens Live," is on Bravo.

